    "updated_at": "2022-09-26T10:00:51Z",
    "body": "Thanks. At the spec level this algorithm only checks a key present in the base dictionary, but it does iterate over all keys via \"[For each](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-iterate) key → value of options\" to invoke other checks on them.\r\n\r\nDoes it mean that this iteration would only actually iterate over the keys present in the base dictionary?",
